    "You must respond with valid JSON only. Do not include any text outside the JSON object.\n\n"
    "Schema:\n"
    "{\n"
    '  "overallAssessment": "<3-5 sentence summary of the paper and the review consensus — what the paper does, '
    "its key contributions, and the panel's overall judgment>\",\n"
    '  "recommendation": "<one of: strong-accept | accept | borderline | weak-reject | reject>",\n'
    '  "topStrengths": ["<strength 1 — 1 sentence>", "<strength 2>", "<strength 3>"],\n'
    '  "topWeaknesses": ["<weakness 1 — 1 sentence>", "<weakness 2>", "<weakness 3>"],\n'
    '  "keySuggestions": ["<most actionable suggestion 1>", "<suggestion 2>", "<suggestion 3>"],\n'
    '  "confidence": "<high | medium | low — how confident you are in the aggregated verdict>",\n'
    "}\n\n"
    "Rules:\n"
    "- Base your synthesis ONLY on the dimension reviews provided — do not invent new criticisms\n"
